OL,3,GNEWSA'Our final chance at parenthood' `
OL,4,Awhy couple filmed One Born Every Minute
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Kate and Matt received a message
OL,7,Fto say that Channel 4's One Born Every
OL,8,FMinute was going to be filmed at the
OL,9,Fhospital where she was due to give
OL,10,Fbirth, they decided they wanted to
OL,11,Fshare their story.
OL,13,FAfter trying to start a family since
OL,14,F2020, the couple from Manchester were
OL,15,Ffinally preparing to meet their first
OL,16,Fchild.
OL,18,FHaving undergone IVF treatment, they
OL,19,Fwere overjoyed to have reached this
OL,20,Fmoment, with their baby having been
OL,21,Fconceived from their final embryo.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
